flowchart TD
  A[Operator approval bound to one source commit]
  B[Admission - quiescence proof, phase plan, build authority, operation lock]
  C[Group 1 - dependency snapshot, offline coverage probe, preparation intent]
  D[Group 2 - offline frozen install and sandboxed runtime and UI builds]
  E[Group 3 - candidate verification by bundled-dependency smoke]
  F[Group 4 - stage copy, equality proof, one atomic rename, final seal]
  G[Group 5 - pre-activation inventory diff zero and durable lifecycle claim]
  H[Group 6 - activation with exactly one supervised restart]
  I[Group 7 - post-activation inventory diff zero after gateway and node]
  J[Group 8 - pre-delivery live acceptance and delivery]
  K[Terminal receipt - runtime-health closeout]
  L[Terminal receipt - full contract accepted]
  STOP[Fail-closed stop - no reseal, no repair in place, evidence retained]
  ADJ[Permit claimed with no completion receipt - external adjudication required]
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D --> E
  E --> F
  F --> G
  G --> H
  H --> I
  I --> J
  J --> K
  J --> L
  B -- host not quiet --> STOP
  D -- build or coverage failure --> STOP
  F -- equality or seal mismatch --> STOP
  G -- any differing row --> STOP
  I -- any differing row --> STOP
  J -- live acceptance false --> STOP
  H -- crash or timeout consumes the one-shot permit --> ADJ
